 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "per-room counts; per-room doubly linked lists in entry order; a sorted doubly linked list of non-empty rooms (a move from r to r + 1 inserts r + 1 right after r and unlinks r when it empties); topPlayers walks rooms from the highest. Complexity target: O(1) per advance and countInRoom, O(k) per topPlayers/O(n + m) space.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
